### 智能客服 - 新增自定义 RAG 知识
POST http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "custom-vip-refund",
  "title": "VIP 客户退款安抚规则",
  "topic": "refund",
  "content": "VIP 客户申请退款时，先查询订单和退款资格；符合规则时说明处理时效，不符合规则时给出替代方案并创建跟进工单。",
  "keywords": ["VIP", "退款", "安抚", "工单", "售后"]
}

### 智能客服 - 删除自定义 RAG 知识
DELETE http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/documents?id=custom-vip-refund

### 智能客服 - RAG 召回率评估：退款
GET http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=超过7天还能退吗&expectedTopics=refund&limit=5

### 智能客服 - RAG 召回率评估：物流
GET http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=订单怎么还没到物流停了怎么办&expectedTopics=shipping&limit=5

### 智能客服 - RAG 召回率评估：复合场景
# 目标：验证一个问题同时命中退款、物流、投诉等多个客服知识主题，并观察 recallRate。
GET http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=订单迟迟不到我想退款并投诉客服&expectedTopics=refund,shipping,complaint&limit=6

### 智能客服 - RAG 召回率评估：闲鱼议价
# 目标：验证闲鱼场景下能召回议价和平台话术知识。
GET http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=闲鱼买家让我便宜50还说马上拍我应该怎么回&expectedTopics=xianyu,price&limit=5

### 智能客服 - RAG 召回率评估：微信售后
# 目标：验证微信客服场景下能召回售后、质量争议和话术知识。
GET http://localhost:8080/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=微信公众号客户说收到商品有瑕疵要求售后怎么处理&expectedTopics=wechat,quality&limit=5

